    "**Eye-Tracking & Neurocognitive Intelligence | Reading Comprehension & Neurocognitive Modelling | Presented by: Reza Saadatyar (2026)**\n",
    "\n",
    "**01 | OneStop Dataset and Experimental Protocol**\n",
    "\n",
    "![OneStop Dataset and Experimental Protocol — scientific workflow](../../images/01_onestop_dataset_and_protocol.svg)\n",
    "\n",
    "**Objective:** Identify ordinary-reading paragraph trials, reconcile the reported outcomes and establish participant-disjoint evaluation.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Dataset:** The official OneStop ordinary-reading fixation and interest-area reports. Published corpus size is not the retained cohort size.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Scope:** Acquire the original paragraph reports, reconcile trial outcomes and define participant and article-batch partitions for subsequent analysis.\n"
   ]
  },
